-- examples/checks/agg-tag-bounded.rofl — agg_tag_bounded, under a budget of
-- 2000 steps: THE CASE f_semiring_needs_parameterized_evaluator RECORDED.
-- Tropical costs over a cyclic graph written as plain rules (`cost(A, C, D)
-- :- cost(A, B, D1), e(B, C, W), D is D1 + W.`) are every path length there
-- is: the in-language simulation of the semiring derived 74 831 cost facts
-- before the budget stopped it, and over this 12-node graph (the ring and
-- twelve chords tests/tag_scale.rs draws) the same rules are cut at 102 202
-- facts by a budget of 200 000. Tagged tropical, the rules are the same
-- without the arithmetic, and they settle inside this budget, one fact per
-- pair, 144, each the cheapest path (Floyd's, below): no wall, no hole.
edb(tb_e).
tb_e(n0, n1, 20). tb_e(n1, n2, 4). tb_e(n1, n6, 10). tb_e(n2, n3, 16). tb_e(n2, n5, 7).
